If there is a surplus of 5 persons in the quota for the Ministry of Employment and Labor (2 of Grade V, 1 of Grade VI, and 2 of Grade VII) and 65 in the quota for institutions affiliated with the Ministry (1 of Grade V, 15 of Grade VI, 21 of Grade VII, 13 of Grade VIII, and 17 of Grade IX), which are to be reduced by the enforcement of this Decree, a separate quota corresponding to the surplus shall be deemed to exist in the Ministry of Employment and Labor and the affiliated agencies, until the number of surplus matches the quota under this Decree.

